488
00:31:49,370 --> 00:31:53,510
In the night sky where even dreams cannot be drawn... was released last week!

489
00:31:53,510 --> 00:31:55,510
Yes, it's here...

490
00:31:55,510 --> 00:31:57,510
I just realized something again...

491
00:31:57,510 --> 00:32:00,010
Everyone in BEYOOOOONDS sings so well!

492
00:32:00,010 --> 00:32:01,510
They are so good!

493
00:32:01,510 --> 00:32:05,230
I've had a lot of inspiration within my own group.

494
00:32:05,230 --> 00:32:07,230
I felt it in this 4th single as well.

495
00:32:07,230 --> 00:32:11,230
I hope you will enjoy their singing voices!

496
00:32:11,230 --> 00:32:13,230
And BEYOOOOONDS 2nd concert tour

497
00:32:13,230 --> 00:32:17,230
The Blu-ray of "BEYOOOOONDS's 2nd Concert Tour in Autumn" is now on sale!

498
00:32:17,230 --> 00:32:21,730
This is the Blu-ray of last fall's tour.

499
00:32:21,730 --> 00:32:23,730
Not only the performance of course, but also the hair and makeup of BEYOOOOONDS.

500
00:32:23,730 --> 00:32:28,730
I hope you will pay attention to BEYOOOOONDS's hair and makeup.

501
00:32:28,730 --> 00:32:30,730
I'd like you to take a look at it.

502
00:32:30,950 --> 00:32:34,950
Project 2023 Spring City Circuit is underway!

503
00:32:34,950 --> 00:32:39,950
Juice-Juice will perform in Hokkaido on April 23rd, and BEYOOOOONDS will perform on April 22nd.

504
00:32:39,950 --> 00:32:43,950
BEYOOOOONDS will perform in Kanagawa on April 22!

505
00:32:43,950 --> 00:32:49,950
Yes, BEYOOOOONDS will perform at Nippon Budokan on May 15!

506
00:32:49,950 --> 00:32:55,950
And Juice-Juice is also scheduled to perform at the Nippon Budokan on May 29!

507
00:32:56,170 --> 00:33:01,170
So, I am looking forward to this day and will do my best in preparation and rehearsal.

508
00:33:01,170 --> 00:33:02,170
Yes, we will do our best!

509
00:33:02,170 --> 00:33:07,170
And on May 2, we will be holding a biophonic concert at the Tokyo Metropolitan Art Space.

510
00:33:07,170 --> 00:33:09,170
Please look forward to it as well!

511
00:33:11,170 --> 00:33:15,170
Hello! Project members will appear on this channel more and more!

512
00:33:15,170 --> 00:33:21,170
New videos will be uploaded every Wednesday, so please subscribe to the channel!

513
00:33:21,170 --> 00:33:25,170
We are still in the midst of an exciting time, but let's get through it together!

514
00:33:25,390 --> 00:33:31,390
With us are Akari Uemura of Juice-Juice and Momohime Kiyama of BEYOOOOONDS Ame no Mori Kawao!

515
00:33:31,390 --> 00:33:33,390
Goodbye.
